    "title": "Ian Ondo",
    "tag": "Talk",
    "text": "Ian Ondo, a former member of the group, came back from UNEP-WCMC to present his current work.",
    "body": [
      "Ian Ondo, a former member of the group and now a biodiversity modeller at UNEP-WCMC working on species distribution, conservation, use and traits, came back to present his current work, including four projects using AI to extract new biodiversity data and to build improved species distribution models."
    ]
